eam/apps/3459080/extras/1c41d0bf5987c7c2e3595211c68b2540.poster.avif?t=1743603873\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459080/extras/1c41d0bf5987c7c2e3595211c68b2540.webm?t=1743603873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459080/extras/1c41d0bf5987c7c2e3595211c68b2540.mp4?t=1743603873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Details</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(19/03/25): The game currently has:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local coop up to 4 players via Steam Remote Play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 enemy types, 1 mini-boss, and special variants of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 droppable items (via the oyster): health pack, xp vacuum, sea-mine, coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 boat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 biome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 abilities. (Boop, Drop Anchor!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 upgradeable stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ persistent upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 gamemode (that changes via modifiers).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
